# Copy this to .env and uncomment/set if testing on a PHYSICAL phone via
# Expo Go — "localhost" doesn't reach your computer from a real device on
# the network. Use your computer's LAN IP (Windows: ipconfig, look for
# "IPv4 Address" under your active network adapter).
# Not needed for Android emulator or iOS simulator — lib/api.ts already
# handles those automatically.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.42:8080
